  "id": "mhc",
  "term": "MHC",
  "definition": "MHC usually refers here to the Mental Health Continuum-Short Form, a questionnaire used to assess well-being. In this source, it is examined in both a retrospective two-week form and a daily diary version, with strongest support for measuring overall well-being and emotional well-being and more caution needed for psychological and social well-being in daily assessment.",
